WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
(audience cheering)
- This is kind of cool

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.520
because sometimes when you're in movies,

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.353
you don't know people,

00:00:03.353 --> 00:00:04.470
but y'all have been
friends for a while, right?

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.580
- Yeah, long time.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.413
- Yeah.

00:00:06.413 --> 00:00:07.246
When did y'all meet?

00:00:07.246 --> 00:00:08.970
- Well.
- (laughing) Well?

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:10.950
- [Kelly] Do you have different stories?

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:14.220
- Kathryn revealed to me only a month ago-

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.090
- Oh, that's right.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.410
We met a long time ago.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.080
- that she asked for a
photo of my twin and I

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.720
at Bob's Big Boy in Los Angeles.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.400
- I was around seven years old.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.110
Huge fan, obviously.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.517
Who wasn't, right?
- Yeah.

00:00:26.517 --> 00:00:27.389
- Everyone here is a fan?

00:00:27.389 --> 00:00:28.830
(audience cheering)

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:31.200
And I'm lucky enough
to be one of the people

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.630
who got a picture with the Sprouse twins.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:34.980
- I didn't remember the moment.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:35.850
- No.
(audience laughing)

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.880
And I didn't tell him about
it until way, way into filming

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.560
because I wanted to
like be cool, you know?

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.393
I wanted be-
- Yeah.

00:00:41.393 --> 00:00:42.226
- We're both actors.

00:00:42.226 --> 00:00:43.256
Like, we're the same.

00:00:43.256 --> 00:00:44.264
We're not the same.

00:00:44.264 --> 00:00:45.136
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:45.136 --> 00:00:46.530
- We are equals.
- We are not the same.

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:47.363
Not at all.

00:00:47.363 --> 00:00:49.230
- Well, you did a photo shoot with,

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.280
'cause I mean, he's a photographer.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.390
We talked about this last time.

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.400
But you did a photo shoot with him,

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.100
and it kind of was like
inspiring for this whole movie,

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:56.933
right?
- Yeah.

00:00:56.933 --> 00:00:59.700
I, you know, I've seen Cole multiple times

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:00.533
throughout the years.

00:01:00.533 --> 00:01:02.550
We met again when he was on "Riverdale"

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:03.960
and I was on "Supernatural."

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:05.430
and he kept talking about my poodles

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:06.840
'cause I have these crazy dogs.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:09.810
And finally I asked you to just shoot

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:12.360
and he shot it in my
house with these wigs.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.520
And it was like, you came
up with this narrative,

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:16.590
like a woman who killed all her husbands

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.130
and is just collecting dogs
and diamonds, you know?

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:22.540
And I feel like it was a
precursor to our film 'cause-

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.630
- Yeah, I gotta talk to my
therapist about that idea.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:26.980
- [Kelly] Yeah, there's
a lot to dive in there.

